{"id":6101,"chapter_id":6,"scene_id":612,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"枷の向こうで、穢れが再びあなたとゾーヤの繋がりを遮断した。頭が割れそうなほどに痛む。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"混沌の声色","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=30><i>またお前……またお前か！</color></i></size>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"混沌の声色","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>帰れ、彼女に触るな！彼女もブラックリングも、俺のものだ！彼女を放せ！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"options":["断る！"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"あなたはそれに負けるわけにはいかない。ゾーヤを他人の手に委ねるわけにはいかない。もしここで手を離せば、永遠に彼女を失ってしまう。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"しかし、ここにいるのはあなただけではない。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"ヘカテー","content":"局長！くっ……！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"ヘラ","content":"手を放して……ダメ……早く放して！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"混沌の声色","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44>放せ！！</size></color>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"どうする！？","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"？？","content":"……手を放してください。","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"低い声があなたの頭の中で響いた。その声は枷の向こう側から来ているが、狂気や暴虐ではなく、勧誘に近い。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？","content":"今はまだその時ではありませんが……まだチャンスはあります……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"？？","content":"……上に来てください……私が……案内しましょう……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"options":["あなたは……誰だ？"],"jump":[16],"style":6,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"その声は遠ざかり、枷の光も共に消失する。あなたはもうゾーヤの気配を感じられなくなったが、それが彼女を失ったことを意味するわけではない。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"そして目の前にいる、あなたたちを塞いでいた汚染の怪物たちが、混乱させられたように、迷いの表情を浮かべていた。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"ヘラ","content":"え、えっと……なに？あの人が目を覚ましたの？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101018"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"options":["分からないが、もうすぐ辿り着けそうだ"],"jump":[20],"style":6,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"二人ともまだ戦えるか？","style":2,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"ヘラ","content":"は……ははっ……あたしが逃げようとしたって、あんたが諦めないじゃん？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101021"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"ヘラ","content":"ハゲ頭までようやく来たんだし、一気に上って終わりにするよ！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6101022"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1}]}